#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
Extended benchmark with full RLG error budget + 1D sweeps + 10 estimators.

Estimators (10, spanning 4 families):
  Kalman     : KF, EKF, UKF, Huber KF
  Gradient   : SGD (covariance-free observer), RLS
  Signal-proc: AR(2) two-stage pipeline, I/Q+OLS fusion
  Fixed-gain : alpha-beta, Complementary

Simulation adds to baseline (ARW-only):
  - Bias instability (OU process on rate)
  - Rate random walk (drift on rate)
  - Scale-factor nonlinearity (quadratic in rate)
  - Temperature drift (affects OmegaL and bias continuously)

Produces 1D sweeps:
  - ARW sweep
  - Contamination sweep
  - Temperature sweep

Hyperparameters tuned on 'realistic_full' across 3 train seeds, then
held fixed across all 1D sweeps (sweeps measure sensitivity, not retuning).

Runtime: ~20 min on Kaggle CPU.
"""
